      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25f-perchlike-fishes-6-gobies/pseudapocryptes_elongatus_en/",
      "html": "<p>A charming goby, imported once more from India. It is a kind of mudskipper, but never leaves the water completely. It only swims in very shallow water.</p><p>The maximum length is around 20 cm, but most specimens stay much smaller (around 12 cm).</p>"
    },
